sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Founder as Entrepreneur
    participant FE as Entrepreneur Dashboard (src/app/dashboard/entrepreneur)
    participant CC as CompanyController (api/company)
    participant CS as CompanyService (5,952 lines)
    participant DC as DealsController (api/deals)
    participant DB as MongoDB (Companies, CapTable, DataRooms, Deals)

    Founder->>FE: 1. Complete Onboarding / Level Up
    FE->>CC: POST /api/company/level-up
    CC->>CS: EnsureLevelUpCompanyAsync(userId, ideaId)
    CS->>DB: Insert Companies document
    CS->>DB: SeedCapTableFromOwnershipAsync (Phase 4)
    CC-->>FE: Return Company Profile

    Founder->>FE: 2. Cap Table & Dilution Setup (Phase 4)
    FE->>CC: POST /api/company/cap-table/vesting
    CC->>CS: SaveVestingSchedulesAsync
    CS->>DB: Insert Phase4VestingSchedules & Phase4CapTables

    Founder->>FE: 3. Data Room Document Ingestion (Phase 6)
    FE->>CC: POST /api/company/data-room/upload
    CC->>CS: UploadDataRoomDocumentAsync
    CS->>DB: Store Document & Access Rules
    FE->>CC: POST /api/company/data-room/publish
    CC->>CS: PublishDataRoomAsync

    Founder->>FE: 4. Matchmaking & Diligence Review (Phase 7/8)
    FE->>CC: GET /api/company/matched-investors
    CC->>CS: GetMatchedInvestorsAsync
    CS->>DB: Query InvestorMatches & SmartMatchRuns

    Founder->>FE: 5. Term Sheet & Deal Negotiation (Phase 9)
    FE->>DC: POST /api/deals/{dealId}/counter
    DC->>DB: Update Deal status = CounterOffered
    DC->>DB: Write DealExecutions audit log
    FE->>DC: POST /api/deals/{dealId}/signing/sign
    DC->>DB: Update Deal status = FullySigned
    DC->>CS: ApplyEquityDealToCapTableAsync
    CS->>DB: Mutate Phase4CapTable & RecordShareIssuance
